- @ref pfqn_mvald.m "pfqn_mvald" - Exact MVA for load-dependent closed queueing networks.

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [XN, QN, UN, CN, lGN, isNumStable, pi] = pfqn_mvald(L, N, Z, mu, stabilize)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>L</td><td>Service demand matrix.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>N</td><td>Population vector.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Z</td><td>Think time vector.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>mu</td><td>Load-dependent rate matrix (MxNt).</td></tr>
  <tr><td>stabilize</td><td>Force non-negative probabilities (default: true).</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
