  <tr><td>UN</td><td>Utilization.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>CN</td><td>Cycle times.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>lGN</td><td>Logarithm of normalizing constant evolution.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>isNumStable</td><td>Numerical stability flag.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pi</td><td>Marginal queue-length probabilities.</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Exact MVA for load-dependent closed queueing networks.

