- @ref pfqn_qd.m "pfqn_qd" - Queue-Dependent (QD) approximate MVA solver.

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [Q, X, U, iter] = pfqn_qd(L, N, ga, be, Q0)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
