  <tr><td>Q</td><td>Mean queue lengths.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>X</td><td>System throughput.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>U</td><td>Utilization.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>iter</td><td>Number of iterations performed.</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Queue-Dependent (QD) approximate MVA solver.

