@section alg_cache Cache Algorithms (matlab/src/api/cache/)

The cache module provides algorithms for analyzing cache systems with various
replacement policies (LRU, FIFO, RR, etc.) and item popularity distributions.

@subsection alg_cache_functions Key Functions

<b>Primary Methods:</b>
- @ref cache_erec.m "cache_erec" - Recursive computation of the normalizing constant for cache models

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  cache_erec(...)
  @endcode

  <b>Description:</b> Recursive computation of the normalizing constant for cache models

- @ref cache_gamma_lp.m "cache_gamma_lp" - Computes gamma parameters for cache models using linear programming

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [gamma, u, n, h] = cache_gamma_lp(lambda, R)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>lambda</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>R</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>gamma</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>u</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>n</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>h</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Computes gamma parameters for cache models using linear programming

- @ref cache_miss_fpi.m "cache_miss_fpi" - Computes miss rates using fixed-point iteration

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [M, MU, MI, pi0] = cache_miss_fpi(gamma, m, lambda)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>gamma</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>m</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>lambda</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>M</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MU</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MI</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Computes miss rates using fixed-point iteration

- @ref cache_miss.m "cache_miss" - Cache miss rate computation

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [M, MU, MI, pi0] = cache_miss(gamma, m, lambda)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>gamma</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>m</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>lambda</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>M</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MU</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MI</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Cache miss rate computation

- @ref cache_miss_spm.m "cache_miss_spm" - Computes miss rates using saddle-point method

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [M, MU, MI, pi0, lE] = cache_miss_spm(gamma, m, lambda)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>gamma</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>m</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>lambda</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>M</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MU</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MI</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>pi0</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>lE</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Computes miss rates using saddle-point method

- @ref cache_mva.m "cache_mva" - Exact Mean Value Analysis for caches

  <b>Syntax:</b>
  @code
  [pi, pi0, pij, x, u, E] = cache_mva(gamma, m)
  @endcode

  <b>Parameters:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>gamma</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>m</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

