  <tr><td>t0</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>t1</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>useStiff</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>reltol</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>timestep</td><td>Parameter description</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Returns:</b>
  <table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td>pi</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  <tr><td>t</td><td>Return value</td></tr>
  </table>

  <b>Description:</b> Transient analysis of a continuous-time Markov chain using ODE solvers

